And this week, in your life and in my life,

00:43:16.559 --> 00:43:17.839
there'll be things in every week,

00:43:17.839 --> 00:43:19.719
every day that we face, every day that we live,

00:43:19.719 --> 00:43:21.119
there could be something that comes

00:43:21.439 --> 00:43:25.479
that will cause us to have that sense of fear,

00:43:25.479 --> 00:43:27.279
that response of fear.

00:43:28.959 --> 00:43:32.879
But I hope tonight that we grab hold of

00:43:32.879 --> 00:43:35.199
the truth of God's word,

00:43:35.199 --> 00:43:39.379
that it's not just that God said, don't be afraid.

00:43:39.379 --> 00:43:43.079
God said, don't be afraid because I'm with you.

00:43:43.079 --> 00:43:48.079
And to me, that is so comforting and so impactful,

00:43:48.839 --> 00:43:52.039
because I know that regardless of what we face,

00:43:52.039 --> 00:43:55.199
regardless of what happens in our world,

00:43:55.199 --> 00:44:00.199
God's promises are true, and God's presence is real.

00:44:01.839 --> 00:44:03.459
And we can begin to think about,

00:44:03.459 --> 00:44:06.919
we heard last week from a missionary of some things

00:44:06.919 --> 00:44:08.639
that they've encountered in some things,

00:44:08.639 --> 00:44:12.619
and man, you can only imagine some of the accounts

00:44:12.619 --> 00:44:15.519
and difficulties, but God's with them there.

00:44:16.519 --> 00:44:18.759
And it doesn't matter what that government

00:44:18.759 --> 00:44:21.439
of that country says and what the threats might be,

00:44:21.439 --> 00:44:23.319
just as the case was with Paul,

00:44:23.319 --> 00:44:27.079
before they ever got that trial together

00:44:27.079 --> 00:44:28.919
and before they ever brought him before the judgment seat,

00:44:28.919 --> 00:44:30.959
God spoke to him.

00:44:30.959 --> 00:44:33.959
God said, Paul, I'm with you, don't be afraid.

00:44:33.959 --> 00:44:35.359
Praise the Lord.

00:44:35.359 --> 00:44:39.199
So tonight, as we take the truth that

00:44:39.199 --> 00:44:41.679
God had not given us a spirit of fear,

00:44:41.679 --> 00:44:44.919
I want you to remember, it's not just fear not,

00:44:45.359 --> 00:44:47.239
fear not, fear not, fear not.

00:44:47.239 --> 00:44:50.239
It's fear not, God's with me.

00:44:51.199 --> 00:44:53.639
Fear not, God's with me.

00:44:53.639 --> 00:44:54.959
This situation right here,

00:44:54.959 --> 00:44:56.679
oh, I'm so glad that God's with me.

00:44:56.679 --> 00:45:00.519
If I didn't know God was with me in this, I'd be afraid.

00:45:00.519 --> 00:45:05.079
But because God's with me, I can fear not,

00:45:05.079 --> 00:45:06.559
because God's with me.

00:45:06.559 --> 00:45:08.719
Let's pray, Father, we love you.

00:45:08.719 --> 00:45:10.199
Thank you so much for loving us.

00:45:10.199 --> 00:45:12.519
Thank you for the truth of your word,

00:45:12.519 --> 00:45:14.359
the power of your word.

00:45:14.359 --> 00:45:19.359
I thank you that you didn't just tell us be not afraid.

00:45:21.879 --> 00:45:25.679
You told us why we're to have no fear.

00:45:25.679 --> 00:45:27.199
You've explained to us,

00:45:27.199 --> 00:45:30.159
as we've looked at these various passages of Scripture,

00:45:30.159 --> 00:45:34.279
we've had the opportunity to go through them

00:45:34.279 --> 00:45:38.959
and then to apply in our own lives these principles.

00:45:38.959 --> 00:45:43.919
God, help us to be mindful of your presence,

00:45:43.919 --> 00:45:47.839
to recognize that whatever we may face,

00:45:47.839 --> 00:45:51.319
whatever happens in our lives personally,

00:45:51.319 --> 00:45:55.159
in our community and in our country and our world,

00:45:55.159 --> 00:45:59.279
God, help us to be mindful of the fact that you're with us.

00:45:59.279 --> 00:46:01.079
And because of your presence,

00:46:01.079 --> 00:46:05.159
because you're a very present help in the time of trouble,

00:46:05.159 --> 00:46:09.000
I can fear not, I can be not afraid.

00:46:09.000 --> 00:46:14.000
Lord, help us tonight to live in your presence

00:46:14.239 --> 00:46:16.799
and to follow your principles.

00:46:16.799 --> 00:46:18.479
We'll thank you for the work that you'll do

00:46:18.479 --> 00:46:19.959
for it's in Christ's name we pray.

00:46:19.959 --> 00:46:21.519
Would you stand with me?

00:46:21.519 --> 00:46:22.839
Heads are bowed, eyes are closed.

00:46:22.839 --> 00:46:25.319
Kimberly's gonna play quietly on the piano.

00:46:25.319 --> 00:46:26.799
As she does, the altar is open.

00:46:26.799 --> 00:46:28.639
Maybe you just wanna come talk to the Lord this evening.

00:46:28.639 --> 00:46:30.159
Maybe you just wanna thank him.

00:46:30.159 --> 00:46:32.039
I mean, it's kind of a message that we just rejoice

00:46:32.039 --> 00:46:35.759
and thank God for the reality of his presence.

00:46:35.759 --> 00:46:37.639
Maybe tonight you just say, Lord, you know what?

00:46:37.639 --> 00:46:40.359
You kind of were dealing with some things in my life.

00:46:40.359 --> 00:46:42.239
I've been a little bit afraid about some things

00:46:42.239 --> 00:46:46.199
and uncertainties and fearful, but God, you help me tonight

00:46:46.199 --> 00:46:48.679
and I just wanna commit it to you.

00:46:48.679 --> 00:46:52.279
And Lord, help me as I navigate through these things

00:46:52.279 --> 00:46:55.079
to fear not because you're with me.

00:46:55.079 --> 00:46:57.279
As Kimberly plays, the altar is open.

